  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Drain sweetcorn. Rinse and drain white rice.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook corn until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Add rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667bad81695364690294063f-903aac92.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Thinly slice spring onion.\n• Spread potato and carrot over a large microwave-safe plate. Cover with a damp paper towel. Microwave on high, 4 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667bad81695364690294063f-79762535.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large saucepan over medium-high heat. Add katsu paste, coconut milk, the water (for the curry) and the brown sugar and cook, stirring, until combined and bubbling, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add microwaved veggies and cover with a lid. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until veggies are tender, 8-12 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667bad81695364690294063f-953f7e78.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While curry is simmering, in a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour and sweet soy seasoning. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, combine mixed sesame seeds and panko breadcrumbs (see ingredients).\n• Dip Japanese tofu steaks into flour mixture to coat, then into egg and finally in breadcrumb mixture. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667bad81695364690294063f-2d775987.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook crumbed tofu in batches until golden and cooked through, 2-4 minutes each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra oil if needed so the tofu does not stick to the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667bad81695364690294063f-29adb136.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide corn rice and golden curry between bowls.\n• Top with Japanese crumbed tofu and garnish with spring onion to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667bad81695364690294063f-5447a682.jpeg"
    }
  ]
